WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.480
 You might have heard that your sleep position, whether you're a back, side or stomach sleeper,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.140
 can determine the best mattress for you.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.540
 While that's a great starting point, it's not always the whole story.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:22.180
 For example, a medium firmness is often best for side sleepers, and a firm mattress is

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:27.320
 a solid choice for back or stomach sleepers who need that extra support.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.040
 But here's the twist, preferences aren't so predictable.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:36.300
 Some side sleepers swear by firm, while some stomach sleepers love medium.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.880
 The truth is, the right mattress is the one that feels best for you.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.280
 And at EarthFoam, we're dedicated to helping you find the firmness of your dreams, no matter

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.240
 what position you sleep in.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.600
 If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, please contact us, and we will work

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.800
 with you to find a solution that works.

